  "goodToKnow": "Verstricken means to entangle or embroil: in einen Skandal verstrickt sein, sich in Widersprüche verstricken (to contradict oneself, typically when lying). Die Verstrickung is entanglement or involvement, used for example of individuals' involvement in Nazi crimes. Stricken means to knit, and der Strick is a rope. Not separable: hat verstrickt."
